@UploadService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5264

### CV yükle (multipart/form-data). cv.pdf dosyasını bu .http dosyasının yanına koyun.
POST {{UploadService_HostAddress}}/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=cvboundary

--cvboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./cv.pdf
--cvboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="jobDescription"

Senior .NET Developer - C#, ASP.NET Core, Docker, RabbitMQ, PostgreSQL, Redis
--cvboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
--cvboundary--

###
GET {{UploadService_HostAddress}}/health
